inst/upstream/build-inputs/** -text
# Byte-pinned (SHA-256/MD5-verified) third-party trees: FlatBuffers headers and the FlatBuffers build-copy input,
# the FlatGeobuf schemas/generated headers, their manifests, and the vendored Arrow C ABI header. A platform
# line-ending conversion (e.g. core.autocrlf=true on Windows) would change the hashed bytes.
src/vendor/flatbuffers/** -text
src/vendor/flatgeobuf/** -text
inst/upstream/flatbuffers/** -text
src/arrow-c-abi/arrow_c_abi.h -text
